  "name": "Guiding Bolt",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You hurl a bolt of light toward a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, it takes 4d6 Radiant damage, and the next attack roll made against it before the end of your next turn has Advantage.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.</p><div class=\"cat-description\"><p><em>midi-qol: The next attack roll against the target before the end of your next turn has Advantage.</em></p></div>",
